y by request identity, or completes the original batch despite the mismatched key, would change the judgment.\",\n      \"disposition\": \"active\",\n      \"parent_id\": null,\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"readindex-confirm-handler\",\n        \"readindex-confirm\",\n        \"readindex-test-context\",\n        \"pending-read-addready\",\n        \"pending-read-applied\",\n        \"pending-read-gc\",\n        \"follower-readindexresp\",\n        \"node-process-ready\",\n        \"node-readindex-admission\",\n        \"systemctx-identity\"\n      ],\n      \"resume_conditions\": [],\n      \"knowledge\": [],\n      \"open_gaps\": [],\n      \"latest_execution\": {\n        \"id\": \"c2848ac1c82f442ba305267049bbb53b\",\n        \"experiment_id\": \"827f420be72d403f9a804a543fac77cc-experiment\",\n        \"status\": \"completed\",\n        \"exit_code\": 0,\n        \"record\": \"logs/c2848ac1c82f442ba305267049bbb53b/check.json\",\n        \"observations\": \"logs/c2848ac1c82f442ba305267049bbb53b/observations.json\"\n      },\n      \"latest_interpretation\": null,\n      \"view\": \"preview\",\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"investigations\",\n        \"id\": \"827f420be72d403f9a804a543fac77cc-question-0\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"knowledge\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"827f420be72d403f9a804a543fac77cc-knowledge-0\",\n      \"revision\": 1,\n      \"kind\": \"behavior\",\n      \"statement\": \"readIndex.confirm(ctx, from, quorum) confirms every queued request up to and including ctx and returns each queued readStatus with its original SystemCtx, while rewriting each returned index to the confirmed request's committed index and deleting all returned entries from the queue.\",\n      \"conditions\": \"The leader has multiple pending ReadIndex requests, ctx names a later queued request, and quorum confirmations are received for ctx.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"readindex-confirm\",\n        \"readindex-test-context\"\n      ],\n      \"executions\": {},\n      \"knowledge\": [],\n      \"operation_id\": \"827f420be72d403f9a804a543fac77cc\",\n      \"uses\": [],\n      \"use_paths\": {},\n      \"last_correction\": null,\n      \"view\": \"preview\",\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"knowledge\",\n        \"id\": \"827f420be72d403f9a804a543fac77cc-knowledge-0\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"827f420be72d403f9a804a543fac77cc-knowledge-1\",\n      \"revision\": 1,\n      \"kind\": \"behavior\",\n      \"statement\": \"handleReadIndexLeaderConfirmation adds a local ready-to-read result with each readStatus's own ctx, but for a remote s.from it emits ReadIndexResp using the confirming heartbeat's Hint and HintHigh instead of s.ctx.\",\n      \"conditions\": \"readIndex.confirm returns at least one remote readStatus whose ctx differs from the confirming heartbeat's context.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"readindex-confirm-handler\",\n        \"readindex-confirm\"\n      ],\n      \"executions\": {},\n      \"knowledge\": [],\n      \"operation_id\": \"827f420be72d403f9a804a543fac77cc\",\n      \"uses\": [],\n      \"use_paths\": {},\n      \"last_correction\": null,\n      \"view\": \"preview\",\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"knowledge\",\n        \"id\": \"827f420be72d403f9a804a543fac77cc-knowledge-1\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"827f420be72d403f9a804a543fac77cc-knowledge-2\",\n      \"revision\": 1,\n      \"kind\": \"behavior\",\n      \"statement\": \"The node registers a pending read batch under a generated SystemCtx. pendingReadIndex.addReady updates only a batch whose map key equals the response SystemCtx, and pendingReadIndex.applied completes only a batch with a nonzero ready index not exceeding the applied index. An unmatched response leaves the original batch at index zero.\",\n      \"conditions\": \"A follower-originated read